<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine cash mainly lower.</title>
<headline>Argentine cash mainly lower.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine cash wheat and maize were mostly lower Monday in thin volume, traders said.</p>
<p>They said the market dipped after heavy rains in many parts of the country in recent days and on uncertainty over the state of new sowing. Soybeans fell but were sustained by some buyer interest on the CBOT. Sunseeds slipped amid slim trade.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668</p>
</text>
